ntent_fanyi":"春季，正月初一丙申日，大赦天下，汉桓帝下诏寻找李固的后嗣。当初，李固被下诏策免后，自知难免灾祸，就把三个儿子李基、李兹、李燮都送回故乡。当时李燮十三岁，姐姐李文姬是同郡人赵伯英的妻子，她见到两位兄长从京都洛阳回来，详细了解了事情本末，独自默默悲伤地说：“李氏要灭族了！自从祖父李郃以来，积德累仁，怎么会遭遇这样的灾祸！”她秘密与两位兄长商议，预先将李燮藏了起来，假称李燮已经返回京城，人们全都相信了。不久，祸难发作，州郡官府逮捕李基、李兹，二人都死在狱中。李文姬于是告诉父亲的门生王成说：“您为先父秉持正义，有古人的节操；如今我把未成年的孤儿托付给您，李氏一族的存亡，就全在您了！”王成便带着李燮乘船沿长江东下，进入徐州境内，李燮改名换姓，在酒店里做雇工，王成则在街市上为人占卜，二人各自装作互不相识，暗中往来。过了十多年，梁冀被诛杀之后，李燮才把自己的身世本末告诉酒店主人，酒店主人听后很是震惊，备下车马和丰厚的礼物送他回乡，李燮全都不接受。李燮于是回到故乡，为父亲追补服丧，姐弟相见，悲痛之情感动了身边的人。姐姐告诫李燮说：“我家血脉眼看要断绝，弟弟侥幸活了下来，难道不是天意吗！你应当与众人断绝往来，不要随意交往，千万别说一句指责梁氏的话！指责梁氏就会牵连到主上，大祸就会再次降临，我们只有引咎自责而已。”李燮恭敬地遵从她的教诲。后来王成去世，李燮依礼安葬了他，每年四季祭祀时，都为王成设置上宾的牌位祭奠。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，丙申，赦天下，诏求李固后嗣。初，固既策罢，知不免祸，乃遣三子基、兹、燮皆归鄕里。时燮年十三，姊文姬为同郡赵伯英妻，见二兄归，具知事本，默然独悲曰：「李氏灭矣！自太公已来，积德累仁，何以遇此！」密与二兄谋，豫藏匿燮，托言还京师，人咸信之。有顷，难作，州郡收基、兹，皆死狱中。文姬乃告父门生王成曰：「君执义先公，有古人之节；今委君以六尺之孤，李氏存灭，其在君矣！」成乃将燮乘江东下，入徐州界，变姓名为酒家佣，而成卖卜于市，各为异人，阴相往来。积十余年，梁冀既诛，燮乃以本末告酒家，酒家具车重厚遣之，燮皆不受。遂还鄕里，追行丧服，姊弟相见，悲感傍人。姊戒燮曰：「吾家血食将绝，弟幸而得济，岂非天邪！宜杜绝众人，勿妄往来，愼无一言加于梁氏！加梁氏则连主上，祸重至矣，唯引咎而已。」燮谨从其诲。后王成卒，燮以礼葬之，每四节为设上宾之位而祠焉。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4623,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"97045c20-db0e-11ef-a670-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"玉具，卽玉匣也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"玉具，即玉匣也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"97045c4d-db0e-11ef-a61e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"97045c50-db0e-11ef-86b1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"回天，言權力能回天也。賢曰：獨坐，言驕貴無偶也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"回天，言权力能回天也。贤曰：独坐，言骄贵无偶也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"97045c4f-db0e-11ef-9713-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"97045c52-db0e-11ef-9e70-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"范","people_name_jianti_auto":"范","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"97045c53-db0e-11ef-a66a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"臥虎，言無人敢攖之也。雨之所墮，無不沾濕，言其流毒徧於天下也。考異曰：太子賢註范書，「雨墮」作「兩墮」，云「隨意所爲不定」也。諸本「兩」或作「雨」。按雨墮者，謂其性急暴如雨之墮，無有常處也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"卧虎，言无人敢撄之也。雨之所堕，无不沾湿，言其流毒徧于天下也。考异曰：太子贤注范书，「雨堕」作「两堕」，云「随意所为不定」也。诸本「两」或作「雨」。按雨堕者，谓其性急暴如雨之堕，无有常处也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"97045c51-db0e-11ef-a0bc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"工程营造","official_name":"將作大匠","official_note":"將作大匠是漢代負責宮殿、陵墓等大型工程營造的官員，屬於九卿之一。在《資治通鑑》此段中，描述單超葬禮時動用將作大匠來修建墳墓，顯示其葬禮的奢華和權勢。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"將作大匠起冢塋","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"ac8f4fd6-aae5-481c-bede-109518365673"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"新豐侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"新丰侯","people_xingming":"单超","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"97045c58-db0e-11ef-a34a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"單超","people_name_jianti_auto":"单超","people_xingming":"单超","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"97045c59-db0e-11ef-a9f3-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":165,"link_td_description":"左悺，河南平阳（今河南孟津）人。东汉时的宦官，宦官五侯之一。","link_td_id":"Q10010456","link_td_number_id":1055650,"people_name":"左","people_name_jianti_auto":"左","people_xingming":"左悺","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"97045c5a-db0e-11ef-bdfb-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[左悺]"},{"link_death_year":165,"link_td_description":"具瑗，魏郡元城人（今河北魏县），东汉时的宦官。","link_td_id":"Q10010460","link_td_number_id":1055652,"people_name":"具","people_name_jianti_auto":"具","people_xingming":"具瑗","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"97045c5b-db0e-11ef-9b6d-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[具瑗]"},{"people_name":"徐","people_name_jianti_auto":"徐","people_xingming":"徐璜","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"97045c5c-db0e-11ef-907a-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[徐璜]"},{"people_name":"唐","people_name_jianti_auto":"唐","people_xingming":"唐衡","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"97045c5d-db0e-11ef-b3b6-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[唐衡]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"97045c4c-db0e-11ef-b165-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"yíng","source_anchor_text":"大匠起冢塋其後四侯","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":37,"text":"塋","tongjian_id":"3d6922f4-fcca-5d0f-b156-6521701c21f7"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"97045c4c-db0e-11ef-b165-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"biàn","source_anchor_text":"盜無異虐徧天下民不","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":116,"text":"徧","tongjian_id":"a4c1b9be-5125-5a02-92d8-5db448468032"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","权争"],"content":"2丙午，新豐侯單超卒，賜東園祕器，棺中玉具；及葬，發五營騎士、將作大匠起冢塋。其後四侯轉橫，天下爲之語曰：「左回天，具獨坐，徐臥虎，唐雨墮。」皆競起第宅，以華侈相尚，其僕從皆乘牛車而從列騎，兄弟姻戚，宰州臨郡，辜較百姓，與盜無異，虐徧天下；民不堪命，故多爲盜賊焉。","content_fanyi":"正月十一日丙午，新丰侯单超去世，汉桓帝赐给他东园秘器，也就是御用棺木，棺中放有金缕玉衣；等到下葬时，又调发五营骑士，由将作大匠负责兴造坟墓。此后，其余四侯更加横行霸道，天下人为此流传谚语说：“左悺有回天之力，具瑗独断专行，徐璜如卧虎，唐衡势如大雨倾盆。”四人竞相营建宅第，以华丽奢侈互相攀比，他们的仆从都乘坐牛车，并有骑马卫士随从；兄弟姻亲，有的担任州刺史、郡太守，搜刮百姓，与盗贼没有区别，暴虐行径遍及天下；百姓不堪忍受，所以很多人去做了盗贼。","content_jianti_auto":"2丙午，新丰侯单超卒，赐东园秘器，棺中玉具；及葬，发五营骑士、将作大匠起冢茔。其后四侯转横，天下为之语曰：「左回天，具独坐，徐卧虎，唐雨堕。」皆竞起第宅，以华侈相尚，其仆从皆乘牛车而从列骑，兄弟姻戚，宰州临郡，辜较百姓，与盗无异，虐徧天下；民不堪命，故多为盗贼焉。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4624,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"97045c4c-db0e-11ef-b165-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"中常侍","official_note":"中常侍是东汉时期的宦官官职，负责侍从皇帝、传达诏令，常参与宫廷事务。在《资治通鉴》此段中，侯览担任此职，其行为涉及地方事务，反映了宦官势力的影响。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"中常侍侯覽","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"e1d002fa-08db-438e-b738-bef5d0083ecb"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"宫廷内侍","official_name":"小黃門","official_note":"小黃門是东汉宦官中的低级官职，负责宫廷内的杂务和侍奉。在此段中，段珪担任此职，与侯览一同涉及地方事务，显示了宦官在地方上的干预。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"小黃門段珪","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"91cd8bcd-2a9b-483b-aaf6-726519f8de4d"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"濟北相","official_note":"濟北相是汉代地方官职，负责济北国的行政事务。在此段中，滕延担任此职，处理侯览和段珪的仆从劫掠事件，体现了地方官员的执法角色。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"濟北相滕延","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"71cec540-9f50-4eb8-b528-a37f3209636e"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"司法监察","official_name":"廷尉","official_note":"廷尉是汉代中央司法官职，负责审理重大案件和监察法律执行。在此段中，滕延被征召到廷尉处，反映了中央对地方官员的司法审查。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"徵詣廷尉","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"5f336a20-4b7d-48eb-8910-037ca865421d"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":172,"link_td_description":"侯览，山阳防东人（今山东单县），东汉时的宦官，以诛梁冀功进封高乡侯。","link_td_id":"Q10010462","link_td_number_id":1056062,"people_name":"侯覽","people_name_jianti_auto":"侯览","people_xingming":"侯览","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9706a623-db0e-11ef-a0ca-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":189,"link_td_description":"段珪，济阴人，东汉宦官，“十常侍”之一。","link_td_id":"Q10008955","link_td_number_id":465224,"people_name":"段珪","people_name_jianti_auto":"段珪","people_xingming":"段珪","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"9706a624-db0e-11ef-9bda-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"滕延，字伯行，汉桓帝时北海郡人，后来曾任京兆尹，有政绩，世人为之称为长者。","link_td_id":"Q10007604","link_td_number_id":522931,"people_name":"滕延","people_name_jianti_aut