d":10163,"start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"970729e7-db0e-11ef-b28f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北海","place_name_jianti_auto":"北海","resolved_place_entity_id":595,"start_index":76,"tongjian_id":"97073e0d-db0e-11ef-b7b1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"安丘","place_name_jianti_auto":"安丘","resolved_place_entity_id":3126,"start_index":81,"tongjian_id":"97073e0e-db0e-11ef-9c9a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["权争"],"content":"左悺兄勝爲河東太守，皮氏長京兆趙岐恥之，卽日棄官西歸。唐衡兄玹爲京兆尹，素與岐有隙，收岐家屬宗親，陷以重法，盡殺之。岐逃難四方，靡所不歷，自匿姓名，賣餅北海市中；安丘孫嵩見而異之，載與俱歸，藏於複壁中。及諸唐死，遇赦，乃敢出。","content_fanyi":"左悺的兄长左胜担任河东郡太守，皮氏县长京兆人赵岐把在他手下任职视为耻辱，当天就弃官向西归去。唐衡的兄长唐玹任京兆尹，向来与赵岐有仇怨，于是收捕赵岐的家属宗亲，诬陷他们触犯重法，全部杀害。赵岐四处逃难，没有哪里不曾到过，隐姓埋名，在北海郡的街市上卖饼为生；安丘县人孙嵩见到他，觉得他与众不同，便让他和自己同车回家，将他藏在夹墙当中。待到唐衡兄弟死后，遇上大赦，才敢出来。","content_jianti_auto":"左悺兄胜为河东太守，皮氏长京兆赵岐耻之，即日弃官西归。唐衡兄玹为京兆尹，素与岐有隙，收岐家属宗亲，陷以重法，尽杀之。岐逃难四方，靡所不历，自匿姓名，卖饼北海市中；安丘孙嵩见而异之，载与俱归，藏于复壁中。及诸唐死，遇赦，乃敢出。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4626,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9706a62b-db0e-11ef-9d88-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"97073e14-db0e-11ef-86b4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"積石山","place_name_jianti_auto":"积石山","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"97073e15-db0e-11ef-8ce4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隴西郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"陇西郡","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"97073e16-db0e-11ef-91ab-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河關縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"河关县","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"97073e17-db0e-11ef-8514-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"積石山","place_name_jianti_auto":"积石山","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"97073e18